sequenceDiagram
  participant Client as Client
  participant Vercube as Vercube
  participant ValidationMiddleware as ValidationMiddleware
  participant Schema as Schema
  participant Controller as Controller
  Client->>Vercube: POST /users<br/>{invalid data}
  Vercube->>ValidationMiddleware: Validate request
  ValidationMiddleware->>Schema: schema.parse(data)
  Schema-->>ValidationMiddleware: ❌ Validation Error
  ValidationMiddleware-->>Client: 400 Bad Request
  Note over Client,Controller: Valid request flow
  Client->>Vercube: POST /users<br/>{valid data}
  Vercube->>ValidationMiddleware: Validate request
  ValidationMiddleware->>Schema: schema.parse(data)
  Schema-->>ValidationMiddleware: ✅ Transformed data
  ValidationMiddleware->>Controller: Call handler
  Controller-->>Client: 201 Created
